---
interface Props { id: string; poster?: boolean }
const { id, poster = false } = Astro.props;
const heights = [2,3,2,4,3,3,5,4,3,5];
---
<figure class:list={['project-visual', `visual-${id}`, { 'is-poster': poster }]} aria-hidden={poster ? 'true' : undefined}>
  {id === 'super-happy-space' && <><div class="pipeline"><span>Prompt + music</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Local generation</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Rhythm + gesture</span></div><div class="beat-bars" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:36},(_,i)=><span style={`--bar:${20+((i*31)%75)}%;--delay:${i*-.09}s`}></span>)}</div><div class="visual-bottom"><span>Music informs timing</span>{!poster && <a href="/projects/multiplay/">Motion input: MultiPlay SDK</a>}</div><figcaption>Illustrative pipeline and beat visualiser · planned integrations</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'multiplay' && <><div class="player-flow">{[1,2,3,4].map(n=><div class={`player player-${n}`}><span class="player-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><span>Player {n}</span><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>)}</div><div class="event-stream"><code data-event-flow={poster ? undefined : true}>player: 1 · action: torso_lean</code><span>ActionEvent</span></div>{!poster && <button class="visual-button" data-event-step>Show next player event</button>}<figcaption>Illustrative event flow · simulated player-tagged events</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'document-matcher' && <><div class="document-flow"><div class="sample-document"><span class="eyebrow">Sample booking</span><p>Reference <strong>DEMO-204</strong></p><p>Destination <strong>London</strong></p><p>Packages <strong>3</strong></p><div class="scan-line" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><pre><code>{'{\n  "reference": "DEMO-204",\n  "destination": "London",\n  "packages": 3\n}'}</code></pre></div><figcaption>Synthetic document and JSON · invented demonstration data</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'input-overlay' && <><div class="keyboard-preview" tabindex={poster ? undefined : '0'} role={poster ? undefined : 'group'} aria-label={poster ? undefined : 'Illustrative input overlay. Focus here, then press W, A, S, D or the arrow keys. Press Tab to leave.'} data-keyboard={poster ? undefined : true}><p class="eyebrow">{poster ? 'Keyboard + mouse · native Windows' : 'Focus this preview to try it'}</p><div class="key-row"><kbd data-key="w">W</kbd></div><div class="key-row"><kbd data-key="a">A</kbd><kbd data-key="s">S</kbd><kbd data-key="d">D</kbd>{poster ? <span class="mouse-key">Mouse</span> : <button class="mouse-key" aria-label="Demonstrate mouse click">Click</button>}</div>{!poster && <p class="keyboard-status" role="status">Click or Tab into the preview. Try W A S D or arrow keys.</p>}</div><figcaption>Illustrative web preview · input is read only while focused</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'tetris' && <><div class="tetris-demo"><div class="tetris-board" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:100},(_,i)=>{const x=i%10,y=Math.floor(i/10); return <span class:list={{filled:y>=10-heights[x]!,candidate:(y===3&&x>=3&&x<=5)||(y===2&&x===4)}}></span>;})}</div><div class="heuristic-list"><span class="eyebrow">Candidate evaluation</span><h3>Look beyond<br />the next piece.</h3><p>Holes · Bumpiness<br />Gaps · Height</p><p class="secondary">Compare the current placement and a second move.</p></div></div><figcaption>Recreated illustration · not a live run of the original agent</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'bioreactor' && <><div class="chart-labels"><span>Temperature</span><span class="setpoint-label">Setpoint</span></div><svg class="control-chart" viewBox="0 0 600 210" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative response: temperature approaches a fixed setpoint over time"><path d="M30 15v165h550M30 55h550M30 110h550" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".15"/><path d="M30 55h550" fill="none" stroke="#F1CB7B" stroke-dasharray="7 7"/><path class="response-line" d="M30 175C75 175 90 145 130 112S190 73 245 64 350 56 400 55 520 55 580 55" fill="none" stroke="#8CD6BE" stroke-width="3"/><text x="490" y="205" fill="currentColor" font-size="14">Time</text></svg><div class="control-loop"><span>Sensor voltage</span><span>Temperature estimate</span><span>Proportional heating</span></div><figcaption>Illustrative feedback-control response · not measured data</figcaption></>}
  {id === 'sun-glare' && <><div class="glare-diagram"><div class="glare-frame" aria-hidden="true"><div class="abstract-sun"></div><div class="annotation-box"><span>sun glare</span></div><div class="abstract-horizon"></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">From labels to a detector</p><ol><li>Annotate in Roboflow</li><li>Train a YOLO model</li><li>Detect sun glare</li></ol></div></div><figcaption>Abstract process illustration · not an image or model prediction</figcaption></>}
</figure>
